# Anonymous volumes this stack keeps on purpose, one per line: service, path, reason.
# The deployment verification fails on any anonymous volume not listed here, because
# an anonymous volume is never backed up and is replaced by an empty one on down/up.
mongodb /data/configdb config-server data for sharded clusters; a single-node replica set never writes it
backups /data/db the backups container runs mongodump only; its own data directory stays empty
backups /data/configdb the backups container runs mongodump only
